<!--
  Armor bonus definitions. Edit values here; a restart applies them, no rebuild needed.

  family: slot (Head, Chest, Hands, Feet) owns it. A family belongs to one slot only.
          effect is the native PassiveEffects stat the family changes.
  bonus:  rarity Common, Uncommon, Rare or Legendary. min and max are fractions (0.04 = 4%).
          Value bands must not overlap: each rarity is strictly above the one below.
          skills limits a bonus to weapons of those REBIRTH skills; tags limits it by item tag.
          op base adds to the stat; the default adds a percentage. flat values show as whole numbers.
          context requires the game to be asking about that drop or use, as harvest does.
-->
<armor_bonuses>
